<title>USA: Cash Can sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Cash Can sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cash Can Inc said stockholders of record as of January 3, 1997 will be entitled to a stock dividend of one share of Geo Recycling for every 200 shares owned of Cash Can Inc.</p>
<p>Geo Recycling Inc recently formed an alliance with Cash Can Inc in which a portion of common stock from each company was exchanged thereby reflecting the fair market value for each company.</p>
